{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/steam_gif_1.gif?t=1745396871\" />Dino Quake is a platformer arcade game where you hit the ground to create quakes, stun enemies, then kick them to trigger epic avalanches. The more enemies you catch, the bigger your avalanche becomes. Explore a prehistoric world with multiple stages, with different paths and replayable runs. Play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/items.png?t=1745396871\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/features.png?t=1745396871\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Pure arcade gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 16-bit aesthetics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Charming music tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/dinosaurs.png?t=1745396871\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/cast.png?t=1745396871\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342430?t=1745396871","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342430?t=1745396871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/2af453ce6c11a4d955787fe8053897ead4d7a208/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745396871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor